# --- Corpus & derived data: real-person dossiers. NEVER commit. ---
# NB: excluding data/raw/ alone is NOT enough -- the parsed files carry the same content.
# NB: comments MUST be on their own line; a trailing "# ..." becomes part of the pattern.

# 268 real deep-research dossiers
data/raw/
# chunks.jsonl = FULL verbatim report text; persons.jsonl = 268 real names
data/parsed/
# embeddings: regenerable, and source text is partially recoverable from vectors
data/cache/
data/deep_research_reports
data/mapping

# --- Eval gold set: contains verbatim corpus quotes + personal facts ---
# (schema/rigor is shown publicly via eval/questions.example.jsonl instead)
eval/questions.jsonl
# review_queue.jsonl = same content as questions.jsonl (verbatim quotes + real names) pre-merge.
eval/review_queue.jsonl

# --- Run artifacts ---
# results.jsonl carries retrieved doc text + generated answers.
# config.json / summary.json are pure metrics and safe to commit.
runs/**/results.jsonl
# rankings.jsonl lists ALL 268 doc_ids (real names) per question -- same leak as persons.jsonl.
runs/**/rankings.jsonl

# --- Internal working docs: the private engineering/judgment ledger. ---
# Kept on disk (they govern how the project is built) but not part of the public repo face.
# NB: DECISIONS.md IS public (sanitized ADRs); the rich internal source is notes/ (ignored).
CLAUDE.md
ROADMAP.md
GAPS.md
FORKS.md
notes/

# --- Secrets ---
.env
.env.*
# .env.example is the committed template (no secrets); un-ignore it from the .env.* rule above
!.env.example
*.key
*.pem

# --- Python ---
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/

# --- Parked data-anonymization exploration (not part of the shipped system; references real data) ---
scripts/pseudonymize.py

# --- Judge-calibration artifacts: embed verbatim report text + real names. Keep private. ---
calibration/
eval/calibration_injected.jsonl

# --- Internal workflow skill: references the private planning docs. Keep private. ---
.claude/skills/phase-close/
